{"id": 996888, "slug": "ropukas-idle-island", "name": "Ropuka's Idle Island", "name_original": "Ropuka's Idle Island", "description": "<p>Ropuka's Idle Island is a playable sticker for your desktop. Put it anywhere on your screen and focus on work or fun while the little frog tends to his garden.</p><h3>Cut grass</h3><p>While not sleeping, Ropuka is always cutting grass. Use it as a currency to upgrade his tools, improve the grass' quality or spend it decorating the island.</p><h3>Decorate</h3><p>Unlock new buildings and plants to create your own unique island. Can you get every item and complete the collection?</p><h3>Co-working buddy</h3><p>Ropuka's Idle Island is the perfect game for multitasking. Put it anywhere you want on the screen, resize to take as little or as much space as you want, and the little frog buddy will always be with you when you work, play games, or relax.</p><h3>Lofi and ambient music modes </h3><p>If you need help focusing, Ropuka's Idle Island includes a custom-made lofi track and ambient sounds of nature. Mix and match the audio sources or play in silence to create the perfect workspace.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-01-29", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-10-22T15:01:27", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b50/b50a8731d23072ab7c74b50f313ae22e.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/8a3/8a32ed09e8d29706bca5e7d649d06916.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 2, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": {}, "added": 16, "added_by_status": {"owned": 8, "beaten": 2, "toplay": 6}, "playtime": 4, "screenshots_count": 7, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 30, "parent_achievements_count": 30, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 1, "rat